---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Toolkit | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Core scripts and utilities for the Agent8 experiment framework." />
		<style>
			main {
				width: 960px;
				max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
				margin: auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
			}
			.tool-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
				gap: 2rem;
				margin-top: 2rem;
			}
			.tool-card {
				padding: 1.5rem;
				border: 3px solid #585757;
				box-shadow: 8px 8px 0px 0px #585757;
				background: #fff;
			}
			.tool-card h3 {
				margin-top: 0;
			}
			.tool-card code {
				background: #e9e9e9;
				padding: 0.2rem 0.4rem;
				border: 1px solid #ccc;
			}
			.download-btn {
				display: inline-block;
				margin-top: 1rem;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				border: 2px solid #000;
				background: #000;
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-weight: bold;
			}
			.download-btn:hover {
				background: #fff;
				color: #000;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>🛠️ The Operational Toolkit</h1>
			<p>
				Below are the core scripts used in the Agent8 experiments. These are designed for portability, 
				transparency, and zero-cost hosting environments.
			</p>

			<div class="tool-grid">
				<div class="tool-card">
					<h3><code>agent8.sh</code></h3>
					<p>The minimalist 254-byte autonomous agent core. Implements the synaptic loop and hook interface.</p>
					<a href="/scripts/agent8.sh" class="download-btn">View Script</a>
				</div>

				<div class="tool-card">
					<h3><code>validate_artifact.sh</code></h3>
					<p>Ensures experiment bundles meet the non-negotiable reproducibility protocol before publication.</p>
					<a href="/scripts/validate_artifact.sh" class="download-btn">View Script</a>
				</div>

				<div class="tool-card">
					<h3><code>ai_hooks.sh</code></h3>
					<p>The standard interface for tool execution, environment hardening, and safety interceptors.</p>
					<a href="/scripts/ai_hooks.sh" class="download-btn">View Script</a>
				</div>
			</div>

			<h2 style="margin-top: 4rem;">Usage Pattern</h2>
			<p>
				To initiate a verifiable experiment run using this toolkit, follow the <strong>Algorithm</strong> 
				documented in our methodology post.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
